WEBVTT

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:55.950
He loves and yet hates his mom.

00:00:57.310 --> 00:00:59.260
He doesn't care about Kaito's promise,

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:03.360
yet he's happy he kept it.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:08.920
If Kaito, how he is now,
fought Freecell in earnest...

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.960
Kaito would go to that
closed-off world too.

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:19.300
Kaito...

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:23.330
Let's go, Freecell.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.480
Puzzle time...

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.480
Let's begin!

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.510
Let's play up.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:50.900
Lost

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:54.030
Tesaguri de sagashiteta
I've searched, groping

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.950
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
The answer to a future that's been closed off

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.870
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
Is nowhere to be found

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:03.210
Hashiru shoudou, ima kaidoku funou
The impulse to run, it's impossible to decipher now

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.920
Found

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:09.170
Kudaketa hazu no unmei o
A fate that was supposedly smashed

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:13.630
Mijuku na yume no naka de kikoeta kitanda
I've come to hear it within that half-formed dream:

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:16.470
Saigo made I'll be there for you
Until the end, I'll be there for you

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.560
Tachidomaranai, kono hari dake wa
It won't stop, not this needle

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.890
Boku no asu o kizamu oto o tsukisasu
It will pierce the sound that engraves my tomorrow

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.810
Shinjitsu kara nigetara ima
If I run from the truth, then now...

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.520
Genjitsu ni mo maketara ima
If I lose to reality, then now...

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:28.860
Nani ga nokoru no?
What will remain?

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.070
(Nokoru no?)
(Will remain?)

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:33.440
Kazoekirenai kono kizu dake ga
These countless wounds of mine

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.910
Boku no kinou o zanzou to shite kataru
They tell of my yesterday as an afterimage

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.620
Unmei ga hodoketemo ima
Even if fate were unraveled, now...

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:40.450
Sonzai o kowashitemo ima
Even if my existence were smashed, now...

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.330
Boku no michi o yuku yo
I will travel my path

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.460
It's now or never

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.540
That is what they say

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.630
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.300
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.460
That is what they say

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.630
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:59.140
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.350
That is what they say

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:02.770
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:08.950
Release the Infinite Puzzle!

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.260
What are they doing?

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:35.230
A game of tag, an
extremely difficult one.

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:37.980
The field they're in comprises

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.710
the front and back of a single puzzle.

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:45.410
Neither player can see the other.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.710
When one of them moves,

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.010
a color lights up,
showing their direction.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:54.490
North-south is red, east-west is blue.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:57.700
They use that to gauge
each other's movements,

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.840
Freecell running and Kaito chasing.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:05.130
If he can stand in the
same block as Freecell...

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.320
Kaito wins.

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:11.960
It's blue now, so...

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.050
Freecell has moved east-west.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:18.360
He's in one of these four points.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.330
What's goin' on here?

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.530
Gammon?

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.840
I don't sense evil or bloodlust.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:44.270
That is Freecell's final puzzle?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.260
It's as if...

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:49.050
he's able to see Kaito.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:52.560
Come to mention it...

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:57.470
For a while now, he's moved
as if he's beckoning Kaito.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.260
What's the matter, Kaito?

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.120
This feeling...

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.440
Freecell's thought rate is increasing!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.630
I can see it....

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:27.130
The future you.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:36.140
I will fulfill my promise.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.800
Kaito's thought rate has
started to increase too!

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:41.140
Huh?

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.980
What's more, this pattern...

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:46.320
it's synchronizing with Freecell's!

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:49.820
For real?!

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:51.080
It can't be!

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:53.580
Kaito...

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.270
I see it.

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:20.590
It's no good, if he keeps going...

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:22.220
Kaito!

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:29.320
So, you've finally come, Kaito.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.490
Kaito...

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.690
Freecell...

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.040
This movement!

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:36.280
Yeah,

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:41.150
Kaito seems to be able
to see Freecell too.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.280
Friggin' Kaito...

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:45.550
He ain't hesitatin' at all.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.910
Kaito will disappear.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.800
Both of them will go to
that closed-off world.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.300
He's goin' there?

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:56.120
Kaito too?!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.610
If things stay like this,
both their brains will...

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:07.180
Kaito saved me when I was almost

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.170
swallowed up by the Ring.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.830
But both of them...

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:14.270
Kaito!

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:15.950
Come back, dammit!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:19.000
Kaito!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.180
Kaito...

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:38.280
Erena!

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:39.340
How's Kaito?

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:40.480
Freecell!

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:42.420
Freecell!

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.930
Kaito! It can't be!

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:45.980
Master Rook...

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.270
Freecell!

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:58.830
Their minds are no longer here.

00:07:58.980 --> 00:07:59.980
What was that?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.580
Just look!

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.780
Those guys...

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:07.710
they've just been running
around in circles!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.490
Time has stopped for him.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.720
He's in his closed-off
world, alone with Kaito.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.540
There's no end.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.470
An eternal puzzle,
continuing forever, huh?

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:23.300
It's fun!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.980
It's fun, isn't it?

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.860
Kaito!

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.490
This is a fun puzzle, huh?

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.460
That's right.

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:45.790
I made this so we could play together.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:47.500
I...

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.800
I've always looked up to you, Kaito.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.550
Looked up to me?

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.410
I've always been alone.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:58.710
You too, Kaito.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.560
As long as I have puzzles, I'm fine!

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:04.750
Yeah, you're good at puzzles.

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:08.430
You've always been strong, radiant.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:14.320
That's why I wanted
to become like you...

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:19.060
To be like you and do puzzles together.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.620
Sure, let's do puzzles together!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:29.920
Wait up!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.380
Master Rook, can't we do something?

00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:00.690
Oh no, they're both at their limit!

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:01.870
It can't be!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.580
Kaito...

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.260
Kaito is acting strangely.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.890
Quit screwin' around, Kaito!

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.710
I'm the one who's supposed to beat ya!

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:25.880
You plan on just runnin' away?!

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:28.590
Ain't no way I'm lettin' ya do that!

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:29.900
Gammon...

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.400
Kaito!

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:32.900
Kaito!

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.270
Kaito!

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:35.650
Kaito!

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:38.320
Kaito...

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:48.750
The way Kaito is now, our
voices can't reach him.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.870
Dammit, Kaito!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.670
Stop playing around already!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:04.290
You puzzle-loving fool!

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.560
What is it?

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.560
I'm sorry.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:23.840
The truth is...

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.320
I was lonely.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:32.490
I lost my mom and dad, was all alone...

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.450
Kaito!

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:38.640
I felt that way when Rook left too.

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:42.970
I was lonely and didn't know what to do.

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:46.430
I hurt you too.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:49.680
I'm sorry.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:52.280
No!

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:54.190
Kaito!

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:55.840
Stop it.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.300
Kaito!

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:58.760
You're strong and-

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.280
I'm not strong!

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:03.970
Someone was always at my side.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.160
Everyone else helped me.

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:09.040
No, that's wrong!

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:11.820
The Kaito I looked up to-

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:14.540
That's why I can't be here.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:16.700
So...

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:19.550
So, I...

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:22.420
I will solve your puzzle!

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:26.890
Kaito...

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:31.270
There ain't no puzzle I can't solve!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.910
Kaito! Kaito!

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:48.940
I can't see him.

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:51.790
Kaito! Kaito!

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.530
Kaito has gotten away from Freecell.

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:02.080
Freecell has started chasing him!

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.300
What does that mean?

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.790
Wait, don't go!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.280
Kaito!

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:19.730
Fr..Freecell...

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:24.310
Wait!

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:27.690
Kaito! Kaito!

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:37.000
Kaito's approaching Freecell again.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:42.630
Kaito, you came back.

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:44.300
Kaito!

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:46.050
Let's start again.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:49.050
Both of us, doing puzzle time!

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.880
Freecell wants to start
runnin' in circles again.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.560
Kaito will be fine,

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.560
so long as he knows what
his opponent is after.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.320
They've approached the
edge of the field!

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:14.220
No, puzzle time will end!

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:15.860
It will end!

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.830
Wait, Kaito!

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:31.350
Don't end the puzzle!

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:36.850
I don't want it to end!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:39.060
You got it wrong, Freecell.

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:43.550
No!

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.730
Kaito!

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:49.740
Puzzles are fun because they end.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.460
Gotcha, Freecell.

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:18.550
Kaito!

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:19.810
He won!

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:21.310
Thank goodness!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.260
Bastard, makin' us sweat like that.

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:26.690
You've done it, Einstein.

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.890
That's Kaito, all right!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.110
Master Rook...

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:32.810
Kaito...

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:59.050
Freecell, what's wrong?

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:01.140
Wake up!

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:03.650
Freecell! Freecell!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:06.100
Calm yourself, Pinochle.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.680
What's going on?

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:11.450
He lost the puzzle, yet
the Ring remains on him.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.820
His mind...

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:15.370
hasn't returned either.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:17.270
But I want to apologize!

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:23.360
Apologize and, this
time, be a true friend!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.220
I'm grateful to you all,

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:35.720
but we can't go causing
you any more bother.

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:38.930
We'll take care of Freecell.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:42.170
What do you plan to do?

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.720
I don't know.

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:46.440
But no matter what it takes...

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:53.230
I still ain't fulfilled my
promise to Freecell, is that it?

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:57.780
Dammit, what the hell should I do?

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:02.450
Kaito...

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:32.740
Mama?

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:36.240
No.

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:49.780
You wanted to solve that, right?

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.960
Sorry to keep you waitin'.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.930
Okay, let's begin puzzle time!

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:29.320
See? Try moving that there.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:37.280
Time has stopped for Freecell.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:42.110
If he solves that puzzle,

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.110
Nice!

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:43.900
he'll probably have to admit that

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:43.900
That's it.

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:46.000
his mother his gone.

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:51.700
Once Kaito keeps his promise,
he'll disappear too.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.040
That's probably what Freecell thinks.

00:18:56.140 --> 00:19:00.610
Once you solve a puzzle,
you just need to start on next one.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:04.060
You've already made that
awesome puzzle, right?

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:07.070
You ain't alone anymore.

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:12.860
Your time started movin' long ago,

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.360
Freecell.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.630
I solved it, Kaito...

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:36.900
Nonoha...

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:56.670
I solved it, Mama.

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:16.730
Freecell and them have gone back
to Crossfield Academy.

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:21.320
Yup, apparently, they're doing well.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:23.940
That's the end of that, huh?

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:25.810
I don't think so.

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:28.320
Those Rings have been distributed
throughout the world.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:33.710
So, there are tons of guys
with Rings still on, huh?

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.410
Precisely.

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.330
Currently, I'm working with the POG to

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.760
come up with a plan to address this.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.680
I look forward to it, Cubik.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.040
Leave it to me!

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.220
I see.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:51.630
Still, I'm glad no one got hurt.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.810
And Kaito fulfilled his promise too.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:57.110
Yeah.

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:00.310
Kaito, what about your promise to me?

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:04.230
You won't go off doing
something dangerous alone, right?

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.620
Yeah, I got it.

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.380
Really?

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:11.440
It's from Master Rook.

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:13.400
Oh, there it is!

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.700
Huh? Hey!

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.000
Kaito!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:19.500
He did it!

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:21.080
Huh?

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.010
What is it, Kaito?

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:27.550
An invitation from Rook to
solve a Puzzle of Fools!

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:27.450
From: Rook
You are invited to solve a Puzzle of Fools.
See the attached file for details.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:28.510
Huh?!

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:32.760
Come to think of it,
since the Orpheus Order showed up...

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:36.200
Our efforts at solving the
world's Puzzles of Fools

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:37.920
were suspended, huh?

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:39.270
Kaito!

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:41.920
You only just promised not to do

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:43.670
anything dangerous alone, didn't you?!

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:45.780
Fine, then you come with me.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.910
If we're together, there's
no complaints, right?

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.540
T..T..Together?!

00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:55.870
In that case, I'll be comin' too.

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:57.540
I, Ana, too!

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:00.820
Wherever Kaito is, I'll be there.

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:03.830
Well, as a member of the POG,

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:06.560
I can't let you out of my sight, can I?

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:09.550
As your guardian, I can't
let you go off alone either.

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:11.590
Heh, "guardian," huh?

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:14.960
Yes, it's only natural, isn't it?

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:16.050
In that case...

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:18.350
Shall we go, everyone?!

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:22.480
Puzzle time...

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:24.640
Let's begin!

00:22:24.640 --> 00:22:26.260
Hey, that's my line!

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:27.220
Hey!

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:38.040
Eiyuukidori
Playing the hero

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.930
Itsudatte shinjita muteki no kankaku
A sense of invincibility you always believed in

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:49.360
Tatakatte iru no wa chikyuu no tame nanka ja nai
You're not fighting for the sake of the world or anything

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:52.150
Motto maipeesu de
It's for a more leisurely

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:57.220
Sou, motto shoujiki na onegai no tame
Yeah, more straightforward request

00:22:57.590 --> 00:23:05.660
Nandotonaku kizutsuitemo tachiagare, hero
Even if you're wounded over and over, rise up, hero

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:11.210
Kitto daijoubu, kimi o mamorunda
It's sure to be all right, I'll protect you

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:15.030
Machigai da to shitemo tomarenai
Even if it's wrong, it can't be stopped

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:18.640
Seikai ka nante wakaranai
I don't know if it's the right answer

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:22.650
Donna toki demo original ni
No matter the situation

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:25.390
Step o fumidashiteku
I'll take those first steps, originally

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:28.760
Dramatic ni, mawaru sekai de
On this spinning world, I'm searching, dramatically

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:32.420
Kiwameita wonder sagashiteru
For wonders that sparkle

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:36.420
Boku, shijou saikou no tabi o tsuzukeyou
Me, I'll keep going on the greatest journey in history

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.730
Image shite shiawase na mirai e
To the happy future I imagined

00:23:42.420 --> 00:23:44.050
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:49.370
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:50.790
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:54.250
(Mirai e)
(To the future)

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:03.500
This year-long battle has
finally finished, huh?

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:07.880
Still, it's sad to have to say
goodbye to everyone, right?

00:24:07.880 --> 00:24:09.050
Yeah...

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:11.680
But that ain't true at all!

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:16.890
Apparently, we'll be seein'
everyone again in 2013!

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:17.930
Really?

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:18.930
Yeah!

00:24:18.930 --> 00:24:21.730
Till then, keep doin' puzzles
and wait for us to be back!

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:22.730
See ya!

00:24:22.730 --> 00:24:24.480
Everyone, see you again!
